===Etymology===
{{acronym of|en|{{w|Tom Swift|Thomas A. Swift}}'s [[electric|Electric]] [[rifle|Rifle]]}} Coined in the early 1970s by inventor {{w|Jack Cover}}, after the fictional character created by {{w|Edward Stratemeyer}} in 1910 and especially the volume ''[[w:Tom Swift and His Electric Rifle|Tom Swift and His Electric Rifle]]'' (1911). Genericization of the trademark {{m|en|Taser}}.

